@startuml auth_login_flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Inter, Segoe UI, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowout false

skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #64748B
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
    ArrowColor #475569
    ArrowFontSize 10
}

skinparam activityDiamond {
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    BorderColor #D97706
    FontColor #92400E
}

title **Modern Laravel Blog - User Authentication & Rate Limiting Flow**

|#EFF6FF|User (Browser / Client)|
|#F0FDF4|Breeze Controller & Requests|
|#FEFCE8|RateLimiter & Cache Store|
|#FAF5FF|SQLite Database (Users, Sessions, Cache)|

|User (Browser / Client)|
start
:User navigates to **GET /login**;

|Breeze Controller & Requests|
:Render login view (**<x-guest-layout>**);

|User (Browser / Client)|
:Fill in Email, Password, Remember Me;
:Submit **POST /login**;

|Breeze Controller & Requests|
:Intercept via **LoginRequest**;
:Generate Throttle Key:\n""Str::lower($email) . '|' . $request->ip()"";

|RateLimiter & Cache Store|
:Call **RateLimiter::tooManyAttempts($throttleKey, 5)**;

|SQLite Database (Users, Sessions, Cache)|
:Query **cache** table for attempts count;

|RateLimiter & Cache Store|
if (Attempts >= 5?) then (yes - Rate Limited)
    :Fire **Lockout** Event;
    :Calculate remaining lockout seconds;
    |User (Browser / Client)|
    :Display 429 Throttle Error:\n"Too many login attempts. Please try again in X seconds."; <<#FEE2E2>>
    stop
else (no - Under Limit)
    |Breeze Controller & Requests|
    :Execute **Auth::attempt(['email', 'password'], $remember)**;
    
    |SQLite Database (Users, Sessions, Cache)|
    :Query **users** table by email;
    :Verify password using **Hash::check()**;
    
    |Breeze Controller & Requests|
    if (Credentials Valid?) then (no - Invalid)
        |RateLimiter & Cache Store|
        :Call **RateLimiter::hit($throttleKey)**;
        |SQLite Database (Users, Sessions, Cache)|
        :Increment attempts counter in **cache** table;
        |User (Browser / Client)|
        :Return back with validation error:\n"These credentials do not match our records."; <<#FEE2E2>>
        stop
    else (yes - Valid)
        |RateLimiter & Cache Store|
        :Call **RateLimiter::clear($throttleKey)**;
        |SQLite Database (Users, Sessions, Cache)|
        :Clear key from **cache** table;
        
        |Breeze Controller & Requests|
        :$request->session()->regenerate();
        |SQLite Database (Users, Sessions, Cache)|
        :Insert / update record in **sessions** table;
        
        |User (Browser / Client)|
        :Redirect to intended page or **/dashboard**\n(Authenticated as Author); <<#DCFCE7>>
        stop
    endif
endif

@enduml
